WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.553 --> 00:00:13.399
It was early morning in Mountain National Park.

2
00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:18.262
A skunk walked past a sign that read "Old Misty Geyser."

3
00:00:19.322 --> 00:00:20.583
Bloop! Bloop!

4
00:00:21.404 --> 00:00:22.705
Water bubbled from the geyser.

5
00:00:23.825 --> 00:00:25.306
A drop splashed onto the skunk.

6
00:00:26.327 --> 00:00:27.868
The skunk hurried into the woods.

7
00:00:34.196 --> 00:00:36.798
Crack! A tree fell over as the skunk began to grow.

8
00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:43.322
"Look!" Mara said.

9
00:00:43.342 --> 00:00:47.165
"I see the actor who plays Mighty Man."

10
00:00:48.165 --> 00:00:50.127
Roxy's class was at Mountain National Park.

11
00:00:50.767 --> 00:00:51.688
Lots of people were there.

12
00:00:52.708 --> 00:00:55.150
They stood around Old Misty, the park's geyser.

13
00:00:56.311 --> 00:00:59.113
The actor from Mighty Man was taking a selfie with some fans.

14
00:01:02.075 --> 00:01:03.956
Terrell read a sign near the ranger station.

15
00:01:05.324 --> 00:01:08.527
"The last time Old Misty blew was six years ago."

16
00:01:09.567 --> 00:01:10.728
Roxy looked at the sign.

17
00:01:10.748 --> 00:01:13.230
"We were only two years old then."

18
00:01:15.012 --> 00:01:16.993
She turned and saw her reflection in a window.

19
00:01:17.674 --> 00:01:18.675
She felt strange.

20
00:01:18.695 --> 00:01:21.297
"Weird," Roxy thought.

21
00:01:21.317 --> 00:01:23.799
"I feel like I've been here before."

22
00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:25.781
Someone bumped into her.

23
00:01:25.801 --> 00:01:27.702
"Oof!" Roxy said.

24
00:01:27.722 --> 00:01:30.344
"Sorry, kid!"

25
00:01:31.005 --> 00:01:31.925
A soldier walked by.

26
00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:34.728
A general and some other people followed her.

27
00:01:35.584 --> 00:01:37.285
One person in the group looked familiar.

28
00:01:37.305 --> 00:01:40.386
"That's Dr.

29
00:01:40.446 --> 00:01:41.767
Chen," Roxy thought.

30
00:01:41.787 --> 00:01:43.948
"I met her on the space station."

31
00:01:44.908 --> 00:01:47.329
The scientist pointed a device at Old Misty.

32
00:01:48.369 --> 00:01:49.610
Roxy wanted to say hello.

33
00:01:50.390 --> 00:01:51.791
But she knew she couldn't do that.

34
00:01:52.611 --> 00:01:55.472
"Dr. Chen only knows Rocket Girl," Roxy thought.

35
00:01:56.593 --> 00:01:57.573
Terrell's phone beeped.

36
00:02:00.194 --> 00:02:02.275
"I got a text from my mom," he said.

37
00:02:02.295 --> 00:02:04.816
"I have a dentist appointment this afternoon.

38
00:02:05.760 --> 00:02:07.221
I can still come over for dinner though."

39
00:02:07.241 --> 00:02:09.441
"Great," Roxy said.

40
00:02:10.061 --> 00:02:11.642
Roxy was looking forward to the weekend.

41
00:02:11.662 --> 00:02:14.883
"Terrell is coming over for dinner tonight," she thought.

42
00:02:15.523 --> 00:02:18.464
"Tomorrow we're meeting Mara and Jack at Metro City Mall.

43
00:02:19.164 --> 00:02:21.324
Maybe I won't have to do any Rocket Girl stuff.

44
00:02:21.585 --> 00:02:22.685
I can just have fun!"

45
00:02:22.705 --> 00:02:25.726
"Roxy, Terrell!"

46
00:02:26.066 --> 00:02:26.746
Mara shouted.

47
00:02:26.766 --> 00:02:28.767
"Come over here!"

48
00:02:30.107 --> 00:02:31.767
She and Jack were near Old Misty.

49
00:02:32.308 --> 00:02:33.548
Roxy and Terrell ran over.

50
00:02:34.452 --> 00:02:36.393
"The geyser is bubbling a lot!"

51
00:02:36.833 --> 00:02:37.394
Jack said.

52
00:02:38.554 --> 00:02:39.675
A park ranger smiled.

53
00:02:39.695 --> 00:02:41.756
"This is your lucky day, folks!

54
00:02:42.156 --> 00:02:44.198
Old Misty is about to—" Fwoosh!

55
00:02:44.798 --> 00:02:46.199
Water shot up from the geyser.

56
00:02:47.119 --> 00:02:48.140
Steam filled the air.

57
00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:53.703
The crowd cheered.

58
00:02:54.023 --> 00:02:56.785
Roxy and her friends talked about their weekend plans for a while.

59
00:02:57.645 --> 00:02:59.266
Then she said good-bye and headed home.

60
00:03:00.867 --> 00:03:05.709
She was almost there when her watch beeped.

61
00:03:05.729 --> 00:03:07.131
"Mayor Bloom, what's wrong?

62
00:03:07.612 --> 00:03:08.994
Is a villain causing trouble?"

63
00:03:09.014 --> 00:03:11.899
"No, Rocket Girl," Mayor Bloom said.

64
00:03:11.919 --> 00:03:14.223
"It's not a villain who's causing trouble.

65
00:03:14.784 --> 00:03:16.927
It's a superhero—Mighty Man!"
